      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CLEANUP\n\n• Almost no tests, no auto-checks\n• README is just the default one\n• Two similar UI libraries used\n• A design tool is used as a\n  required part of the app\n• Permission checks are spread\n  over many pages\n• Two login systems to keep in sync",
      "originalText": "CLEANUP\n\n• Almost no tests, no auto-checks\n• README is just the default one\n• Two similar UI libraries used\n• A design tool is used as a\n  required part of the app\n• Permission checks are spread\n  over many pages\n• Two login systems to keep in sync",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "el55",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "baseline": 18
