      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NOT READY FOR AI\n\n• No AI part at all\n• No history of who did what\n• No on/off switches or spend limit\n• No test cases to check the AI\n• No \"AI suggests, human approves\"\n• Products have no extra names, so\n  Hindi / Hinglish words will not match",
      "originalText": "NOT READY FOR AI\n\n• No AI part at all\n• No history of who did what\n• No on/off switches or spend limit\n• No test cases to check the AI\n• No \"AI suggests, human approves\"\n• Products have no extra names, so\n  Hindi / Hinglish words will not match",
      "fontSize": 18,
