      "text": "• Check stock and reduce it when\n   an order is placed\n• Load lists in small pages\n• Keep running counts instead of\n   counting everything each time\n• Write a real README\n• Auto-checks on every change\n• Remove the duplicate UI library\n• Add tests for orders and search",
