      "text": "• A safe place in the server to\n   talk to the AI\n• A short list of things the AI is\n   allowed to do\n• A history log of every AI action\n• A \"waiting for approval\" list\n• Spend limits per user\n• On/off switch for each AI helper\n• 30+ real test cases\n• Protect against tricky text",
