      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHICH MODEL TO USE\n(check latest names and prices)\n\nHaiku 4.5\n  understanding, sorting, support\n  answers (many small requests)\nSonnet 5\n  photo to stock, item swaps,\n  order suggestions\nOpus 5 / Fable 5.1 only for tests\n  or very hard analysis\n\nSave money: reuse repeated parts,\nuse small images, remember\nanswers, keep replies short",
      "originalText": "WHICH MODEL TO USE\n(check latest names and prices)\n\nHaiku 4.5\n  understanding, sorting, support\n  answers (many small requests)\nSonnet 5\n  photo to stock, item swaps,\n  order suggestions\nOpus 5 / Fable 5.1 only for tests\n  or very hard analysis\n\nSave money: reuse repeated parts,\nuse small images, remember\nanswers, keep replies short",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "el205",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "baseline": 17
    },
