      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GOALS TO TRACK (from Step 2)\n\nOwner:\n• time to add first 30 items\n• how often ideas are accepted\n• time to answer an order\nBuyer:\n• search to cart to order rate\n• how often swaps are accepted\n• how often people reorder\nApp:\n• overselling cases = 0\n• AI cost per order\n• AI error / reject rate\n• slowest response time",
      "originalText": "GOALS TO TRACK (from Step 2)\n\nOwner:\n• time to add first 30 items\n• how often ideas are accepted\n• time to answer an order\nBuyer:\n• search to cart to order rate\n• how often swaps are accepted\n• how often people reorder\nApp:\n• overselling cases = 0\n• AI cost per order\n• AI error / reject rate\n• slowest response time",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "el207",
