      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RISKS AND FIXES\n\n• Tricky text in product names\n  → treat as information, confirm\n• Wrong photo reading → owner\n  reviews the list\n• Cost jump → limits and alerts\n• Owner distrust → suggest only\n  first, show reasons\n• Made-up items → tools return\n  only real products\n• Privacy (phone/address) → share\n  the least data with the AI\n• AI service down → fall back to\n  the normal screens",
      "originalText": "RISKS AND FIXES\n\n• Tricky text in product names\n  → treat as information, confirm\n• Wrong photo reading → owner\n  reviews the list\n• Cost jump → limits and alerts\n• Owner distrust → suggest only\n  first, show reasons\n• Made-up items → tools return\n  only real products\n• Privacy (phone/address) → share\n  the least data with the AI\n• AI service down → fall back to\n  the normal screens",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
